.TH FL-EDIT 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-edit \- text editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-edit\fR [\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A tabbed text editor with syntax highlighting for
common languages, find and replace (Ctrl+F, Ctrl+H, F3), go to line (Ctrl+G), auto-indent,
block indent with Tab/Shift+Tab, word wrap and line numbers.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
